                            <note>narration: Four steps, four files you can read. A notebook: your script, with the shots marked inline.  |  moment: The file names must be readable on a phone.  |  from C2/C2.b12  |  words 14–29</note>
                            <marker start="0s" duration="1/30s" value="The file names must be readable on a phone."/>
                        </video>
                        <video ref="r6" name="B3 four files" start="0s" offset="172/15s" duration="82/15s">
                            <note>narration: A catalogue: every clip described, anything unverified marked unknown.  |  moment: The file names must be readable on a phone.  |  from C2/C2.7e3  |  words 30–38</note>
                            <marker start="0s" duration="1/30s" value="The file names must be readable on a phone."/>
