                        <asset-clip ref="r7" name="B4 the reel" start="0s" srcEnable="video" offset="254/15s" duration="36/5s">
                            <note>narration: Then the reel. Every picture is pinned to a word, not a timestamp, so re-recording the voice moves nothing you approved.  |  from C3/C3.301  |  words 39–59  |  flag aspect-mismatch: A14 is 1920x1080 in a 9:16 reel — it will be cropped or letterboxed  |  flag text-type: classified as 'caption' by heuristic — confirm title / caption / subtitle in the tracks page  |  flag cut-moved: the footage ends 0.111s before the planned cut, so the cut moved earlier to 24.119s (still after the line ends)</note>
