                            <note>narration: Last, a real timeline for Final Cut Pro or DaVinci Resolve: editable clips, titles, lanes. What it cannot represent, it refuses.  |  from C4/C4.1b6  |  words 60–80  |  flag aspect-mismatch: A03 is 1918x1200 in a 9:16 reel — it will be cropped or letterboxed  |  flag aspect-mismatch: A04 is 2160x1920 in a 9:16 reel — it will be cropped or letterboxed  |  flag text-type: classified as 'caption' by heuristic — confirm title / caption / subtitle in the tracks page</note>
